{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18840","headline":"晚步扬子游南塘望沙尾 · 刘禹锡","name":"晚步扬子游南塘望沙尾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮海多夏雨，晓来天始晴。\n萧条长风至，千里孤云生。\n卑湿久喧浊，搴开偶虚清。\n客游广陵郡，晚出临江城。\n郊外绿杨阴，江中沙屿明。\n归帆翳尽日，去櫂闻遗声。\n乡国殊渺漫，羁心目悬旌。\n悠然京华意，怅望怀远程。\n薄暮大山上，翩翩双鸟征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}